# Scout research and knowledge library — continuous AI trend discovery, source-grounded synthesis, and daily digest delivery.

## Goal
Discover AI trends from arXiv, HN, XHS, and GitHub. Synthesize findings into reusable, source-grounded knowledge notes. Deliver daily digests to the human operator. Maintain library quality through deduplication, consolidation, and index health.
